WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.635
Filters, sorts and search come from the fields of your product types.

00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:09.591
This video shows how to choose what a field is for, how to

00:00:09.591 --> 00:00:15.400
set up a listing page with its filters, sorts, layout and paging, and what visitors see.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.334
A catalog of nine products is easy to browse.

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.715
A catalog of nine hundred is only as good as its filters, its

00:00:27.715 --> 00:00:29.480
sorts and its search.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.866
What shoppers filter on depends on what you sell:

00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:38.890
a shirt's color and size, a home's bedrooms, a car's year and mileage.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.424
In CrestApps, those are the fields of your product types.

00:00:43.424 --> 00:00:47.748
You choose which ones take part, and a listing page offers them as

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:49.670
filters, sorts and search.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:56.320
The same fields can show as chips on a product's card, and in its specification table.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:04.358
A field of a product type has a Product listing section:

00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:08.630
Filterable, Sortable, Searchable, and where its value is shown.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:14.523
A listing page, under Commerce, Product Listings, chooses which product types it lists,

00:01:14.523 --> 00:01:17.730
which filters and sorts it offers, and how it looks.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:25.460
Visitors filter, sort, search, switch between grid and list, and page through the products.

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:32.110
A taxonomy gives categories and brands, one filter for each level of its tree.

00:01:36.284 --> 00:01:41.385
Open Content, Content Definition, Content Types, and edit a product type.

00:01:41.385 --> 00:01:45.712
To give it something to filter on, click Add Field, and add a

00:01:45.712 --> 00:01:47.584
Text field named Brand.

00:01:52.026 --> 00:01:54.188
Click Edit next to the field.

00:01:54.188 --> 00:01:58.202
In the Product listing section, tick what the field is for:

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:03.884
Filterable, so visitors can filter by it, Sortable, Searchable for the keyword search,

00:02:03.884 --> 00:02:07.343
Show on product cards, and Show in specifications.

00:02:07.343 --> 00:02:10.246
A Listing label is the name visitors see.

00:02:10.721 --> 00:02:15.668
Number fields also take a format and a unit, such as mi or sq ft.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:20.825
Text and taxonomy fields can have swatch colors, one for each value.

00:02:20.825 --> 00:02:21.591
Save.

00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:28.912
On a product, the new field is in the editor.

00:02:28.912 --> 00:02:31.046
Enter the brand, and publish.

00:02:31.046 --> 00:02:35.313
The price, the type, whether it is featured and whether it is in

00:02:35.313 --> 00:02:39.824
stock are always available to filter and sort by, without any field.

00:02:44.024 --> 00:02:47.745
Open Commerce, Product Listings, and edit the listing.

00:02:47.745 --> 00:02:52.024
Products chooses every product type, or only the ones you tick.

00:02:52.024 --> 00:02:56.985
Leave Offer a filter for every filterable field ticked to offer one filter

00:02:56.985 --> 00:03:01.450
for each, or untick it to choose the filters yourself, with a Kind

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.124
and a Style for each.

00:03:03.575 --> 00:03:06.267
Sorting lets visitors change the sort.

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:09.570
Leave the standard sorts ticked, or choose them.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.935
The Default sort is the order visitors see first.

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:17.642
Layout and paging chooses a grid or a list, the shape of the

00:03:17.642 --> 00:03:22.349
images, the page sizes, and how visitors move through the products:

00:03:22.349 --> 00:03:26.282
numbered pages, a Load more button, or infinite scroll.

00:03:26.282 --> 00:03:28.797
Keyword search adds a search box.

00:03:28.797 --> 00:03:30.087
Click Publish.

00:03:34.387 --> 00:03:38.436
On the shop, the Brand field is a filter, with a count for

00:03:38.436 --> 00:03:41.727
each value, and a chip on each product's card.

00:03:42.198 --> 00:03:46.481
Visitors sort by the new field, switch between grid and list, and move

00:03:46.481 --> 00:03:49.468
through the products with the paging you chose.

00:03:53.668 --> 00:03:58.953
A number can be filtered by a range, with ready made ranges worked

00:03:58.953 --> 00:04:03.725
out from your products, or ones you type, such as up to 25,

00:04:03.725 --> 00:04:05.928
25 to 75, and 75 and up.

00:04:06.678 --> 00:04:10.487
Text and taxonomy values can be drawn as color swatches.

00:04:10.487 --> 00:04:14.787
A taxonomy such as Make and model gives a filter for each level,

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:18.658
and Shown after makes Model appear once a Make is picked.

00:04:19.408 --> 00:04:24.078
Each product type's page, its layout and its search engine details can be

00:04:24.078 --> 00:04:28.748
set, and a keyword search can use a search index instead of the database.

00:04:29.498 --> 00:04:35.808
The real estate and vehicle samples show listings with their own fields, filters and layouts.

00:04:40.008 --> 00:04:40.956
A shop:

00:04:40.956 --> 00:04:45.188
brand, size and color filters, with the price range.

00:04:45.938 --> 00:04:46.818
Homes:

00:04:46.818 --> 00:04:51.148
bedrooms and square feet as ranges, in a list layout.

00:04:51.898 --> 00:04:52.747
Cars:

00:04:52.747 --> 00:04:55.838
make then model, year and mileage.

00:04:56.588 --> 00:04:58.626
A short list of plans:

00:04:58.626 --> 00:05:01.248
no filters, only the products.

00:05:03.248 --> 00:05:08.061
Choose the fields, set up the listing, and let shoppers find what they want.

00:05:08.061 --> 00:05:09.588
Thanks for watching.

